    section: "3", questionRef: "2022 HL Section 3 Q7(A)(iii)",
    stem: "Read the information supplied and answer the questions which follow. The Cleaning Crew, a home and industry cleaning company based in Wexford, has seen growth in demand for its services across the south. It is considering expanding the company across Ireland based on research undertaken. Management are considering all finance options to fund expansion. The following figures are taken from the final accounts of The Cleaning Crew for 2021 and 2020.",
